config SFF8472
	bool "SFF-8472 (SFP/SFP+) module management decoding"
	help
	  Enable decoding of the SFF-8472 management memory map used by SFP,
	  SFP+ and SFP28 pluggable transceivers: the serial ID page (A0h) and
	  the real-time digital diagnostic monitoring page (A2h).
